        {"do": "text", "text": "Bat + Ball = $1.10"},
        {"do": "text", "text": "Bat = Ball + $1.00"},
        {"do": "text", "text": "Ball = ?", "color": "orange"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "Your brain says ten cents. But check it. If the ball is ten cents, the bat is one dollar ten, and together that is one dollar twenty. Too much!",
      "steps": [
        {"do": "text", "text": "Quick guess: 10¢", "color": "red"},
        {"do": "math", "tex": "0.10 + 1.10 = 1.20", "plain": "0.10 + 1.10 = 1.20", "color": "red"},
        {"do": "text", "text": "Too much!", "color": "red"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "Let the ball cost x. Then the bat costs x plus one. Together, x plus x plus one equals one point one zero. So two x equals ten cents, and x is five cents.",
      "steps": [
        {"do": "text", "text": "Let ball = x"},
        {"do": "math", "tex": "x + (x + 1) = 1.10", "plain": "x + (x + 1) = 1.10"},
